Scope guidance:
- Judge the whole assembled feature across all repositories in the workspace.
- Use the approved roadmap as scope context for the completed feature, not as a reason to ignore feature-level gaps.
- Do not apply per-phase deferral criteria; the full feature is in scope at Final Review.
